  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43/ESP32-S3-AMOLED-1.43-Demo-V3.zip). Sold with one of two panels under the same part number. This is the SH8601 one (its id register 0xDA reads 0x86); if the picture sits 6 columns to the left, choose the CO5300 preset. Every pin recorded agrees between the vendor's code and the schematic's GPIO table (QSPI 9/10/11-14, RST 21, OLED_EN 42, I2C 47/48, SD 38-41, BAT_ADC 4, BOOT 0). Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
